<title>USA: Richardson Electronics Q2 div at $0.04.</title>
<headline>Richardson Electronics Q2 div at $0.04.</headline>
<dateline>LAFOX, Ill 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		    Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $0.04		     $0.04</p>
<p> Pay	     Nov 27</p>
<p> Record	  Nov 14</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is Richardson Electronics Ltd.</p>
<p>Company said it was the cash dividend for the second quarter of the 1997 fiscal year.</p>
<p>A dividend of 90 percent of the dividend paid on the common stock will be paid to holders of 3.2 million shares of class B common stock.</p>
